# Copy to .dev.vars for `npm run dev`. On the deployed worker BRAIN_TOKENS is a secret.

# One entry per person, as token=owner, comma separated. An unknown or missing token gets 401 before
# any tool runs, and there is no default owner. The owner names the notes a write produced and is what
# lets two people share one brain.
BRAIN_TOKENS=replace-with-openssl-rand-hex-32=adam,replace-with-another-hex-32=kate

# Optional. Defaults shown.
# CORE_TOKENS=900
# MAX_NOTE=300
# INSTRUCT_TOKENS=300
# TIMEZONE=Australia/Brisbane

# Optional. Only needed once you serve a custom hostname; localhost and workers.dev are accepted
# without it.
# BRAIN_HOSTNAME=brain.example.com
